# CareConnect – Healthcare Support Web App

CareConnect is a simple healthcare support web application designed to help people submit support requests to an NGO or community support team.

The main purpose of the project is to make the support-request process simple and organized. Users can submit their basic details and explain what type of help they need. An AI-assisted feature then creates a short summary of the request and suggests a support priority for the NGO team.

> **Note:** This is a concept-level educational prototype. It does not provide medical diagnosis, treatment, or emergency medical services.

---

## Features

* Simple and responsive healthcare support form
* User can select the type of support required
* AI-assisted request summary
* AI-based support priority suggestion
* Suggested action for NGO volunteers
* Clean and responsive UI
* Separate frontend and backend
* REST API using Express.js
* MongoDB support for storing requests
* Error handling and basic form validation

---

