## Disclaimer

CareConnect is an educational prototype created for demonstrating frontend, backend, database, and AI integration.

The application should not be used as a replacement for professional medical advice, diagnosis, treatment, or emergency services.

No real patient or sensitive medical information should be submitted to the demonstration version.


